{{Quote|He's tough, targets buildings and explodes when destroyed, slowing nearby enemies. Made entirely out of ice... or is he?! Yes.}}

The Super Ice Golem was a temporary {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]], only available in certain Events. It spawned a very slow, single-target, [[:Category:Building Cards|building]]-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with very high hitpoints and low damage. When defeated, the Super Ice Golem exploded, dealing damage, while additionally stunning anything for 4 seconds. The Ice Golem takes the appearance of a large creature made out of snow with glowing team-colored eyes and ice shards on his head, with his hands being mostly made of ice, and his nose and rocks on his spine being in the form of coal. A Super Ice Golem card cost 4 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

==Strategy==
*If your opponent defeats a Super Ice Golem, their [[King's Tower|King Tower]] will immediately activate from the freeze damage, and vice versa. This makes decks that revolve around cards such as [[Graveyard]] and [[Goblin Barrel]] much less effective, since the King's Tower will also be available to shoot at the spawned troops.
**However, timing the Graveyard after a Super Ice Golem freeze can be devastating, since it forces the opponent to react to it and will usually do huge damage, especially if the opponent does not have proper Graveyard counters. A similar strategy works for Goblin Barrel.

